      {
        "id": "JaxR",
        "name": "Grandmaster-at-Arms",
        "description": "Every third consecutive attack deals additional Magic Damage. Additionally, Jax can activate this ability to deal damage around himself and strengthen his resolve, increasing his Armor and Magic Resist for a short duration.",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Every third Attack within 2.5 seconds deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(75/130/185 + (60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Jax slams his lantern down, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(100/175/250 + (100% Attack Damage)) magic damage</span> to nearby enemies. If he hits a champion he gains <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">(45/60/75 + (40% bonus Attack Damage)) Armor</span> and <span>(27/36/45 + (24% bonus Attack Damage)) Magic Resist</span> plus <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">(20/25/30 + (10% bonus Attack Damage)) Armor</span> and <span>(12/15/18 + (6% bonus Attack Damage)) Magic Resist</span> per additional champion hit for 8 seconds. During this time every second Attack deals additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">magic damage</span> instead of every third.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals 50% damage to structures.</span>",
